the top of all martial arts!

263
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:35,300
And in my place, you will become the
grandmaster of the Bookshelf Swordsmanship...

264
00:15:42,020 --> 00:15:45,520
Fought Andy Trafun at the K-1 Grand Prix,

265
00:15:46,660 --> 00:15:49,287
and took him down with
a masterful heel drop.

266
00:15:49,337 --> 00:15:52,220
He will spread the true Honden
Kenpō throughout the world.

267
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:58,640
Once he became the kickboxing champion,
the first step of that plan,

268
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:01,480
Gantetsu not only ran away from home,

269
00:16:02,220 --> 00:16:04,240
