276
00:16:22,220 --> 00:16:22,700
No matter what.

277
00:16:22,700 --> 00:16:23,260
No.

278
00:16:24,900 --> 00:16:27,280
You look sexy up close, you know.

279
00:16:28,360 --> 00:16:30,080
