across the vast desert.

428
00:24:52,020 --> 00:24:59,000
I want to be freer than a bird.

429
00:25:00,020 --> 00:25:07,120
A lady's dreams that change
as fast as a kaleidoscope.

430
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:15,240
My heart's longing, sorry, wait for me.

431
00:25:15,240 --> 00:25:22,240
The dazzling brilliance of
living a panoramic future.

432
00:25:23,460 --> 00:25:30,120
You understand, don't you?
Sorry, wait for me.

